	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『エピソード5／帝国の逆襲』に登場した「AT-ST」と「スノースピーダー」がビークルモデルで登場！",
			"• 手のひらに収まるスモールサイズの中に、こだわりのディテールを表現。",
			"• スノースピーダーはシールによりルーク機のカラーを再現。",
			"• AT-STは『エピソード5／帝国の逆襲』版を立体化！「1/144 AT-AT（別売）」と組合わせることで惑星ホスで繰り広げられた雪上戦闘シーンを再現できる！",
			"• 「スノースピーダー」専用のディスプレイベースも付属。",
			"• AT-ST：全高約60mm",
			"・スノースピーダー：全長約40mm"
		],
		"en": [
			"• \"AT-ST\" and \"Snowspeeder\" that appeared in \"Episode 5: The Empire Strikes Back\" are now available as vehicle models!",
			"• Expressing detailed details in a small size that fits in the palm of your hand.",
			"• Snowspeeder uses Seal to reproduce the color of Luke's aircraft.",
			"• AT-ST is a three-dimensional version of “Episode 5: The Empire Strikes Back”! By combining it with \"1/144 AT-AT (sold separately)\", you can recreate the snow battle scene that took place on the planet Hoth!",
			"• A display base for \"Snowspeeder\" is also included.",
			"• AT-ST: Total height approx. 60mm",
			"・Snowspeeder: Total length approximately 40mm"
		]
	},
